    It means there are two consecutive similar chunks of lines in both files.
    Thus remove last entry and update the last line numbers in the first entry

    >>> remove_successive(all_couples)
    >>> all_couples
    {(11, 34): ([5, 10], [27, 32]),
     (23, 79): ([15, 19], [45, 49])}
